<title>HONG KONG: Int'l Bank of Asia sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Int'l Bank of Asia sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the arrangers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL BANK OF ASIA</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$500 MLN   COUPON     3MH+50   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	   ISS PRICE  PAR	LAUNCH   14.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	   CALLS	NONE     REPLIES  29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    --	     REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    --</p>
<p> RATING     BBB	    SALE LMTS  --	 TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    --	     CRS DEF    --	 FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  HONG KONG    GOV LAW    --	 PAY DATE MID-DEC.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS   HK$50 MLN+    87BP   ALL-IN  79</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	     HK$25-49 MLN  81BP   ALL-IN  77</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   SAKURA FINANCE ASIA (BOOKS), COMMERZ (EAST ASIA)</p>
<p>		 (BOOKS), DRESDNER (SOUTH EAST ASIA) AND WESTPAC</p>
<p>		 BANKING CORP'S HONG KONG BRANCH (PAYING AGENT)</p>
<p> NOTES   THE ISSUE HAS BEEN FULLY UNDERWRITTEN BY THE ARRANGERS.</p>
<p>	   SIGNING IS SET FOR DECEMBER 12.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
